+or GPU: parser/prefix-size/suffix computation, engine-counts consistency
+(prompt==len(ids), reused==k, read==prompt-reused), exact checkpoint-row marker
+(`resume from chain at K (checkpoint row)` with K==k), tail-turn gating, mutated-case
+false positives (old root / older-than-newest fail), missing/bad metric/log failures,
+the no-tautology rule (read is compared to the INDEPENDENT suffix, never rec['suffix']),
+genuine-root rule, and the mutated candidate-set proof (Sol design: early assistant
+mutation, L1<=change, header mismatch before n-1, no unexcluded periodic).
